    <summary type="html">
      <![CDATA[This easter at Lab401, we're giving away much more than melted chocolate and sugar highs. Starting from Thursday, April 18 - specific orders will win prizes, including the NFCKill, USBKill and Proxmark RDV4!<p><a class="read-more" href="https://lab401.com/blogs/news/lab401-easter-prize-hunt-keysy-in-stock">More</a></p>]]>
