    <content type="html">
      <![CDATA[<p style="line-height: 18px; text-align: justify; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;"><strong>Did you know</strong><span> </span>that in France, it's not the Easter Bunny that delivers Easter Eggs, but<span> </span><em>church bells</em>. Somehow, magical bunnies seems more logical. Regardless - this easter at Lab401, we're giving away much more than melted chocolate and sugar highs.</span></p>
<p style="line-height: 18px; text-align: justify; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">Starting from <strong>Thursday, April 18</strong><span> </span>-<span> </span><strong>specific orders will win prizes.</strong></span></p>
<p style="line-height: 18px; text-align: justify; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">The <strong>fifth, tenth and fifteenth</strong> orders placed will win a<span> </span><strong>USBKill Pro Kit, NFCKill Pro Edition</strong><span> </span>and a<span> </span><strong>Proxmark 3 RDV4</strong><span> </span>respectively. </span></p>
<p style="line-height: 18px; text-align: justify; font-size: 12px;"><span style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px;">From the Lab401 Team - have a safe and relaxing Easter, and enjoy the hunt!</span></p>
